        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item" onclick="toggleFAQ(this)">
        <div class="faq-question">
          <span class="faq-question-text">How long does shipping take?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">
            <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none"><path d="M6 2v8M2 6h8" stroke="white" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
          </span>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          All orders are processed and dispatched within 24 hours of being placed (Monday–Friday). Standard shipping takes 3–5 business days within the contiguous US. We also offer express 1–2 day shipping at checkout. Free standard shipping applies to all orders over $49. International shipping is available to most countries — rates and times calculated at checkout.
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item" onclick="toggleFAQ(this)">
        <div class="faq-question">
          <span class="faq-question-text">Is there a warranty on Sleep Space products?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">
            <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none"><path d="M6 2v8M2 6h8" stroke="white" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
          </span>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          Every Sleep Space product comes with a 12-month manufacturer warranty covering defects in materials and workmanship. If your product fails under normal use conditions within 12 months of purchase, we will replace it free of charge. Additionally, all products are backed by our 30-day money-back satisfaction guarantee — if you're not happy for any reason, simply contact us for a full refund.
        </div>
      </div>
