          <span class="faq-question-text">Is the head cap machine washable?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">
            <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none"><path d="M6 2v8M2 6h8" stroke="white" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
